<h4 id="route-parameters" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Route Parameters</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#route-parameters" aria-label="Link to Route Parameters"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h4>
<p>Route parameters allow you to capture parts of the URI as variables. They&#x27;re particularly helpful for creating dynamic routes. Let&#x27;s create a route to display a specific user&#x27;s details:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="php"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)">Route</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">::</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">get</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">(</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">&#x27;/users/{id}&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">,</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> [</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)">UserController</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">::class</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">,</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;show&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">]</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">)</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8