<p>Middleware acts as a powerful mechanism for filtering HTTP requests hitting your application. It&#x27;s essential for implementing features like authentication, CORS handling, and request/response modifications. In Laravel 11, the way middleware is handled has been streamlined for better performance and easier configuration.</p>
<p>By using middleware, you can:</p>
<ol>
<li>Perform actions before the request reaches your application</li>
<li>Perform actions after the application generates a response</li>
<li>Modify the request or response as needed</li>
</ol>
