<p>Consider indexing:</p>
<ul>
<li>Foreign keys</li>
<li>Columns used in WHERE clauses</li>
<li>Columns used for sorting (ORDER BY)</li>
</ul>
<p>Remember, while indexes speed up reads, they can slow down writes, so use them judiciously.</p>
<h4 id="chunking-results" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Chunking Results</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#chunking-results" aria-label="Link to Chunking Results"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h4>
<p>When working with large datasets, use chunking to process records in batches:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="php"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)">User</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">::</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">chunk</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">(</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)">100</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)">,</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> function</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> ($users) {</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">    foreach</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> ($users </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">as</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> $user) {</span></span>
